      "id": 1,
      "text": "Merrittstown began as “New Town,” growing around Samuel Douglas’s 1785 mills that made it a frontier hub for milling, trade, and defense.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
